WEBVTT

00:01.170 --> 00:03.510
<i>You might win an extra item!</i>

00:04.290 --> 00:08.740
I'm thinking of holding a 
Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix.

00:08.740 --> 00:10.090
<i>T-Too close...</i>

00:10.090 --> 00:10.940
Hey!

00:10.940 --> 00:12.730
Back off there, Munami!

00:13.180 --> 00:14.740
Sorry, sorry.

00:15.130 --> 00:19.640
And so, there are a lot more 
refugees in the village now.

00:19.640 --> 00:23.780
This'll be a good way to deepen our 
friendships with the new residents.

00:23.780 --> 00:26.580
I want to hold some big festival!

00:26.580 --> 00:30.760
And what I came up with is the 
Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix.

00:30.760 --> 00:34.590
<i>That's a good idea. The eating 
contest we held was a big success,</i>

00:34.590 --> 00:37.620
<i>and this will serve as a 
diversion for everyone.</i>

00:37.620 --> 00:39.010
<i>Might b-ea n-igh-s.</i>

00:39.010 --> 00:40.170
I know, right!

00:40.170 --> 00:43.080
And so, I'd like you to 
help a little, Boxxo.

00:43.080 --> 00:45.510
I'll pay you one—no, two gold coins.

00:45.510 --> 00:49.110
I'd like to reward the 
champion with the chance

00:49.110 --> 00:52.000
to get fifty of their favorite 
product from you, free of charge.

00:52.000 --> 00:53.180
What do you think?

00:53.180 --> 00:55.470
<i>At that point, I'd still 
finish way up in the black.</i>

00:55.470 --> 00:57.340
<i>There's no reason to refuse.</i>

00:57.340 --> 00:58.830
<i>Hello there.</i>

00:58.830 --> 01:00.490
Thank you, Boxxo!

01:00.490 --> 01:01.580
That's a big help!

01:01.580 --> 01:03.830
The Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix?

01:04.650 --> 01:06.660
Shirley might be a contender.

01:06.660 --> 01:08.290
That's true.

01:08.290 --> 01:11.260
She has the looks, and she's 
used to public attention.

01:11.260 --> 01:12.980
Hey, you two.

01:13.340 --> 01:15.380
You sound like you won't be in it,

01:15.380 --> 01:17.350
but I say you will be.

01:17.350 --> 01:18.880
Huh?!

01:18.880 --> 01:20.760
No, I will <i>not</i> enter something like that!

01:20.760 --> 01:23.300
I don't want to either! I'm too shy!

01:23.750 --> 01:27.010
I'd be willing to give you a 
week's worth of free meals here.

01:27.010 --> 01:28.760
Well...

01:28.760 --> 01:30.800
I'm a no, no matter what.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.270
Aw, don't you want to see 
what they can do, Boxxo?

01:34.270 --> 01:37.470
<i>What?! Now you're putting this on me?!</i>

01:37.470 --> 01:40.500
<i>What's the correct way to respond?</i>

01:40.500 --> 01:44.660
<i>Should I say no, or yes, to this?!</i>

01:44.970 --> 01:46.120
<i>Too bad.</i>

01:46.120 --> 01:49.170
<i>I'll say something vague that 
can be taken either way!</i>

01:49.170 --> 01:51.700
Which is that supposed to mean?!

01:51.700 --> 01:53.920
Be specific, Boxxo.

01:53.920 --> 01:55.550
<i>Wait, what?</i>

01:55.780 --> 01:58.720
I guess it's not good to be pushy.

01:58.720 --> 02:03.660
Oh well. You know, if Shirley wins...

02:03.660 --> 02:10.130
"I'm so overcome with emotion, I might grab 
Boxxo and give him a passionate kiss."

02:11.600 --> 02:13.540
Or, so she was saying.

02:13.540 --> 02:15.620
But you two are not in.

02:17.350 --> 02:19.820
What is it, Lammis?

02:19.820 --> 02:22.020
I-I'll...

02:22.020 --> 02:25.040
I'll enter the Dungeon 
Goddess Grand Prix, too!

02:25.040 --> 02:27.700
Okay, Lammis has decided to enter.

02:27.700 --> 02:32.160
You're considerably popular here, so 
that could make you a top contender.

02:32.160 --> 02:34.120
<i>Munami's enjoying this.</i>

02:34.120 --> 02:35.710
What about you, Hulemy?

02:35.710 --> 02:37.960
Not that you have to feel 
pressured or anything.

02:37.960 --> 02:39.660
I-I'll...

02:40.550 --> 02:43.730
I'll d-do it, too.

02:43.730 --> 02:44.540
Huh?

02:45.850 --> 02:47.290
What?!

02:47.290 --> 02:48.060
Really?!

02:48.060 --> 02:52.510
L-Lately I've been developing 
an "attraction" magic item.

02:52.510 --> 02:56.690
Entering wouldn't be so bad, and 
it c-could help me do research.

02:56.690 --> 02:59.340
Then the both of you are participating.

02:59.990 --> 03:02.570
Things have gotten interesting.

03:02.570 --> 03:05.940
<i>Munami, you've got a super-sleazy 
look on your face.</i>

03:06.270 --> 03:09.160
<i>I bet that bit about Shirley was a lie, too.</i>

03:09.160 --> 03:12.580
<i>But hey, if they're both entering, 
they've got my full support!</i>

03:15.090 --> 03:17.960
<b>Reborn as a Vending Machine,
I Now Wander the Dungeon</b>

03:20.430 --> 03:22.350
<i>On the outside, a rectangular steel box.</i>

03:22.350 --> 03:24.250
<i>Hidden within is a human soul!</i>

03:24.250 --> 03:29.640
<i>In a world of wonder, I go to and fro 
on the back of my partner Lammis!</i>

03:25.350 --> 03:31.230
<b>Reborn as a Vending Machine,
I Now Wander the Dungeon</b>

03:29.640 --> 03:32.070
<i>I am Boxxo! Hello there!</i>

03:32.070 --> 03:33.820
<i>That means "yes"!</i>

04:48.480 --> 04:50.480
<i>Form change!</i>

04:51.520 --> 04:54.980
<b>The Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix</b>

04:53.060 --> 04:54.980
Oh, a festival!

04:54.980 --> 04:58.850
There's been so much fighting lately, 
it'll be nice to have one of these!

04:59.170 --> 05:00.320
I'll be sure to go!

05:00.320 --> 05:02.350
Yeah, I look forward to it.

05:02.350 --> 05:04.660
It's being held in a week.

05:04.660 --> 05:06.640
This looks like much fun!

05:06.640 --> 05:08.110
And rebuilding is coming along well.

05:08.540 --> 05:12.620
My company will contribute 
something as well.

05:14.860 --> 05:17.530
I'm planning on taking part, too.

05:17.530 --> 05:20.360
Festivals like this really are fun.

05:20.360 --> 05:24.120
I'm entering on behalf 
of our local citizenry.

05:24.120 --> 05:26.880
<i>Sh-She won't be easy to beat!</i>

05:27.200 --> 05:29.910
<i>Although I'd like to give my 
two the upper hand somehow.</i>

05:29.910 --> 05:32.860
<i>Do I have some product 
that could help them out?</i>

05:33.370 --> 05:37.000
Let's begin the "How Can We Win 
the Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix?"

05:37.000 --> 05:38.930
emergency meeting.

05:39.880 --> 05:42.970
I'll get that Boxxo gift 
certificate no matter what!

05:42.970 --> 05:44.640
Let's do this!

05:44.820 --> 05:47.510
<i>It seems there will be quite a few entrants,</i>

05:47.510 --> 05:50.410
<i>so these three have decided to join forces.</i>

05:50.410 --> 05:52.640
First, about the proceeds on the day of.

05:52.640 --> 05:55.160
We each get a turn to go onstage 
and introduce ourselves.

05:55.160 --> 05:57.670
The rule for that is, we have 
to wear our everyday outfits.

05:57.670 --> 06:00.040
Maybe we should put a lot of energy into it.

06:00.040 --> 06:01.920
Yeah! That we should!

06:01.920 --> 06:03.860
Next we demonstrate special skills.

06:03.860 --> 06:08.670
But we also have to show off 
our appeal at the same time.

06:08.670 --> 06:11.050
And we can wear whatever we like.

06:11.050 --> 06:12.640
Special skills?

06:12.640 --> 06:14.000
That's archery, for me.

06:14.000 --> 06:17.260
I wonder if I could pick up heavy stuff?

06:17.260 --> 06:20.010
I could try showing some inventions.

06:21.100 --> 06:22.760
The problem is...

06:23.280 --> 06:24.540
...outfits.

06:24.540 --> 06:25.780
You got it.

06:27.180 --> 06:30.550
All I have besides this is 
sleepwear and everyday clothes.

06:30.550 --> 06:31.950
Oh, same here.

06:31.950 --> 06:34.830
I've never given much thought to dressing up.

06:35.280 --> 06:37.030
<i>What a sad conversation.</i>

06:37.030 --> 06:42.830
How about redoing the outfits we 
have now, so they show more skin?

06:42.830 --> 06:45.090
Oh, that might work!

06:45.090 --> 06:46.830
No, not so fast.

06:46.830 --> 06:50.070
Do you think you can beat Shirley 
when it comes to showing skin?

06:51.310 --> 06:53.210
I can't beat that!

06:53.530 --> 06:58.450
<i>In my personal opinion, they have a shot if 
they compete in terms of healthy beauty.</i>

06:58.450 --> 07:01.480
<i>But I also think I'd like 
them to not expose too much.</i>

07:01.480 --> 07:02.810
Hup.

07:02.810 --> 07:07.590
There's a shop that sells fabric, and 
I could always sew something together.

07:07.590 --> 07:09.560
Shui, you can make clothes by hand?

07:09.560 --> 07:11.910
They've always been popular 
at the orphanage.

07:11.910 --> 07:15.370
Buying children's clothes in the 
dungeon can be a real pain.

07:15.370 --> 07:18.040
Then we just have to come 
up with some designs.

07:18.040 --> 07:20.380
But I don't think I'd do a good job.

07:20.380 --> 07:23.870
I-I'm not sure I know how 
to do that stuff either.

07:23.870 --> 07:28.750
I'm good at children's clothes, but I 
don't know how to do dressy outfits.

07:30.920 --> 07:34.390
<b>Weekly Youth
 Um... Would you like to join me? Top new pin-ups!
 Shonen SteP</b>

07:30.990 --> 07:34.390
Boxxo? Why'd you suddenly change shape?

07:34.550 --> 07:36.640
<b>Weekly Youth
 Everyone loves it!
 I want to copy it right now! How to dress SAILORS style.</b>

07:35.150 --> 07:36.630
What's this?

07:36.640 --> 07:37.850
<b>Like it's the future
A revolution in photo printing</b>

07:36.640 --> 07:42.390
<b>This salty-sweet combo is both oversized and sporty.
 Fresh and girly, a salty-sweet revolution of gaucho pants and sports jersey.</b>

07:36.950 --> 07:39.690
There are some very pretty 
pictures in these books.

07:39.690 --> 07:42.390
They're wearing clothes I've never seen.

07:39.890 --> 07:42.390
<b>An interview with
 SAILORS CEO Shizuka Miura!!</b>

07:42.390 --> 07:44.390
This outfit's cute!

07:44.390 --> 07:46.790
Oh, this sort of thing could work.

07:46.790 --> 07:47.710
Uh-huh!

07:47.710 --> 07:49.360
Oh, this is cute, too!

07:49.360 --> 07:52.900
Is this what they wear in the 
world Boxxo's from? Wow!

07:52.900 --> 07:54.910
Oh, I like this look!

07:55.250 --> 07:57.160
That would work on me!

07:57.160 --> 07:58.670
This looks great, too!

07:57.280 --> 07:58.660
It really does!

07:59.200 --> 08:02.190
<i>I had a feeling they'd lose 
themselves in this sort of thing.</i>

08:02.190 --> 08:04.110
Oh, I like this one!

08:04.110 --> 08:05.860
How about this one?

08:08.160 --> 08:11.050
Okay! We have some kind of plan.

08:11.050 --> 08:13.990
I'll put together outfits 
for the three of us!

08:13.990 --> 08:15.170
Thanks!

08:15.170 --> 08:18.310
We'll think up an idea for 
your archery demonstration!

08:18.310 --> 08:22.610
<i>We've been through a lot lately,
so I'm just glad they're having fun.</i>

08:22.610 --> 08:26.850
<i>As for what kind of outfits they settled on,
seems I'll find out on the day of.</i>

08:26.850 --> 08:29.110
Hip hip hooray!

08:29.740 --> 08:32.860
<i>I'll have to see if I can come 
up with some way to help, too.</i>

08:33.940 --> 08:38.860
<i>The day has finally come for the Dungeon 
Goddess Grand Prix, or DGGP for short.</i>

08:38.860 --> 08:41.110
Clearflow's festivals are amazing!

08:41.110 --> 08:43.530
I haven't had this much fun in ages!

08:43.530 --> 08:44.920
Morning...

08:44.920 --> 08:46.190
Good morning, Shui!

08:46.190 --> 08:47.010
Hey.

08:47.010 --> 08:49.550
I managed to finish the outfits.

08:49.850 --> 08:52.430
<i>Shui must have been up all night sewing.</i>

08:52.430 --> 08:57.190
Sorry. Like we agreed, we'll give 
you the prize if one of us wins.

08:57.190 --> 09:00.020
Yeah, I don't see myself winning.

09:00.020 --> 09:02.080
But if I'm lucky enough to 
pull it off, it's yours.

09:02.080 --> 09:03.360
I appreciate it.

09:03.360 --> 09:05.680
Well, Boxxo! Cheer for us!

09:05.680 --> 09:07.200
<i>S-ea you.</i>

09:09.070 --> 09:12.560
<i>Oh crap! I can't see the stage from here!</i>

09:12.570 --> 09:14.570
<b>Hunters Association</b>

09:12.570 --> 09:14.570
<b>I'm here.</b>

09:12.570 --> 09:14.570
<b>Green room</b>

09:12.570 --> 09:14.570
<b>Stage</b>

09:12.570 --> 09:14.570
<b>Audience</b>

09:12.880 --> 09:17.550
<i>And it'd be overblown to move using the 
cardboard-vending-machine-and-balloon combo.</i>

09:17.550 --> 09:18.690
Boxxo.

09:18.970 --> 09:21.240
Thank goodness for the nice weather today.

09:21.240 --> 09:23.350
I bet you don't have much 
of a view from here.

09:23.350 --> 09:26.730
I'm thinking of moving you to where 
visibility's best. Do you mind?

09:26.730 --> 09:28.460
<i>Thank you very much.</i>

09:28.460 --> 09:30.700
<i>Director Bear with the save!</i>

09:32.800 --> 09:33.900
It's almost time.

09:33.900 --> 09:35.830
<i>What's the meaning of this?</i>

09:35.830 --> 09:38.410
Oh, Boxxo's here, too!

09:38.410 --> 09:40.810
I've sure been lookin' forward to today!

09:40.810 --> 09:43.820
Too much so, in fact. I've got 
dark spots under my eyes.

09:43.820 --> 09:46.260
Do you have them under yours 
too, Director Clearflow?

09:44.520 --> 09:48.300
I see Director Dark is as talkative as ever.

09:46.260 --> 09:49.020
Then could you give my face a quick look,
and see if they're visible?

09:48.300 --> 09:51.600
Speaking of talkative, guess 
what happened yesterday.

09:49.020 --> 09:50.770
But good luck even finding them!

09:50.770 --> 09:53.210
But I tell ya, bein' a 
judge makes me nervous.

09:51.600 --> 09:53.280
We're been working feverishly

09:53.280 --> 09:55.990
to learn the Clearflow stratum's rules 
ever since this place took us in.

09:53.860 --> 09:57.040
<i>Director Dark on the left, 
Director Labyrinth on the right.</i>

09:55.990 --> 09:58.330
So, I went to say hello to my 
neighbor in the next tent over.

09:57.040 --> 09:59.100
<i>Worst surround sound ever.</i>

09:59.990 --> 10:03.140
Could you two cut down on the chatter?

10:03.140 --> 10:04.490
We'll be starting soon.

10:04.490 --> 10:07.490
You're judges, so I want 
you to judge properly.

10:07.490 --> 10:09.250
Yes, I understand.

10:09.250 --> 10:12.000
Okay, I'll give it my best shot.

10:12.000 --> 10:13.900
<i>Whew, good.</i>

10:13.900 --> 10:16.250
<i>But wait, what am I doing here?</i>

10:16.250 --> 10:19.540
I thought I'd have you be a judge, Boxxo.

10:19.540 --> 10:23.010
It was originally going 
to be Director Origin,

10:23.010 --> 10:25.930
but for various reasons, she can't do it.

10:25.930 --> 10:28.760
And so Boxxo got appointed instead?

10:28.760 --> 10:32.280
I trust you're still gonna be fair 
about it, even with friends competin'.

10:32.280 --> 10:36.910
<i>I'm happy to know you're confident 
in me, but now I have to be a judge?</i>

10:37.870 --> 10:39.740
<i>That's a big responsibility.</i>

10:40.280 --> 10:42.040
Munami!

10:42.040 --> 10:44.770
Hello, everyone! Thank you for your patience!

10:44.770 --> 10:52.530
And now, for the first installment of the 
Clearflow Lake stratum Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix!

10:48.580 --> 10:52.540
<b>Emcee Munami</b>

10:52.530 --> 10:55.540
Let's go ahead and meet our participants!

10:55.540 --> 10:58.050
Here's our very first, to lead us off!

10:58.050 --> 11:00.800
It's Acowi from the Exchange House!

11:01.300 --> 11:03.940
The only thing I'm after 
is that grand prize.

11:03.940 --> 11:08.800
There's nothing in this world more enticing 
than something free, with no strings attached.

11:04.850 --> 11:08.810
<b>Exchange House</b>

11:04.850 --> 11:08.810
<b>Acowi</b>

11:10.810 --> 11:13.760
Next is Fia, the pretty girl 
from the item shop!

11:13.760 --> 11:17.060
It turns out, she was secretly 
popular with our male hunters,

11:17.060 --> 11:22.570
but I hear there's been lots of grief ever 
since she started going out with Karios!

11:21.450 --> 11:25.320
<b>Item Shop</b>

11:21.450 --> 11:25.320
<b>Fia</b>

11:22.570 --> 11:25.330
U-Um, I'll do the best I can.

11:25.330 --> 11:27.610
She's so cute!

11:29.080 --> 11:31.710
Moving along, it's the sole 
female in the Band of Gluttons!

11:31.710 --> 11:35.030
She's quick on her paws and has 
a big appetite! It's Suco!

11:34.750 --> 11:38.710
<b>Band of Gluttons</b>

11:34.750 --> 11:38.710
<b>Suco</b>

11:35.030 --> 11:38.710
I want to win and stuff my 
belly with fright chikin!

11:38.710 --> 11:40.960
Suco! You can do it!

11:40.960 --> 11:41.970
Entry number four!

11:41.970 --> 11:44.730
She entered yesterday, which 
was at the last minute!

11:44.730 --> 11:47.180
It's Director Origin!

11:44.760 --> 11:48.220
<b>Director Origin</b>

11:50.840 --> 11:53.720
You look lovely, Director Origin!

11:53.720 --> 11:56.910
Don't forget to smile! You can do it!

11:57.520 --> 12:00.400
Whoa! Did you see that glare? Scary!

12:00.400 --> 12:05.060
It's no surprise. It was your 
provocations that got her to compete.

12:05.060 --> 12:07.530
No clue what you're talkin' about.

12:07.530 --> 12:11.550
<i>Oh, so that's why I'm here as a judge.</i>

12:13.580 --> 12:16.730
This stratum is looking after 
my stratum's residents.

12:16.730 --> 12:20.540
I entered to liven up this 
festival a little more.

12:20.540 --> 12:24.950
Director! Director! Director!

12:24.950 --> 12:26.430
And now, our fifth entrant!

12:26.430 --> 12:29.190
She also provided a prize 
for this grand prix!

12:29.190 --> 12:32.380
Our corporate little lady, Suori!

12:30.680 --> 12:35.100
<b>Wealthy Merchant's Daughter</b>

12:30.680 --> 12:35.100
<b>Suori</b>

12:32.380 --> 12:35.150
I'm here to win first place.

12:35.150 --> 12:37.220
May this be a good contest.

12:38.990 --> 12:42.660
Number six is another adorable entrant!

12:42.660 --> 12:44.980
It's Kikoyu!

12:46.810 --> 12:48.210
I'll do my best!

12:48.210 --> 12:52.380
Also, don't forget that I'm selling 
fresh vegetables over there.

12:48.530 --> 12:52.370
<b>Snow Fairy</b>

12:48.530 --> 12:52.370
<b>Kikoyu</b>

12:55.080 --> 12:58.290
Does everyone have a favorite so far?

12:58.290 --> 13:01.500
But there are still more 
you have yet to see!

13:01.720 --> 13:03.120
Number seven.

13:03.120 --> 13:06.680
The hunter with the stomach of steel. Shui!

13:04.920 --> 13:08.800
<b>Stomach of Steel</b>

13:04.920 --> 13:08.800
<b>Shui the Hunter</b>

13:06.680 --> 13:10.020
I'm going to win and fill 
my stomach to bursting!

13:10.020 --> 13:11.730
There are only three left!

13:11.730 --> 13:14.820
Who could the next challenger be?!

13:14.820 --> 13:18.090
<i>Manami's starting to sound 
like this is a prizefight.</i>

13:18.400 --> 13:23.030
Our brilliant magic item engineer, Hulemy!

13:20.560 --> 13:24.490
<b>Magic Item Engineer</b>

13:20.560 --> 13:24.490
<b>Hulemy</b>

13:23.030 --> 13:25.030
Hulemy, are you pumped?

13:25.030 --> 13:27.120
Eh, well, I'll give it a shot.

13:27.120 --> 13:29.870
Now, the second from the last!

13:29.870 --> 13:31.620
She's one of the favorites to win!

13:31.620 --> 13:34.130
Nothing slows down this super-strong girl.

13:34.130 --> 13:37.890
Lammis the hunter!

13:35.250 --> 13:38.620
<b>Super Strong and Full of Energy</b>

13:35.250 --> 13:38.620
<b>Lammis the Hunter</b>

13:38.630 --> 13:42.490
Boxxo, I'm gonna give it my best!

13:43.390 --> 13:48.880
<i>Huh? Could it be Lammis is 
more popular than I imagined?</i>

13:48.880 --> 13:52.070
And! The final entrant is...!

13:52.070 --> 13:54.970
Hearsay has it she's the favorite to win!

13:55.900 --> 13:58.390
You've been waiting for this!

14:00.810 --> 14:03.540
It's Shirley!

14:01.980 --> 14:05.900
<b>Shirley, the Favorite to Win (No Title Needed)</b>

14:04.830 --> 14:09.210
Everyone, please cheer for me.

14:15.400 --> 14:17.300
<i>What's with this cheering?!</i>

14:17.300 --> 14:18.660
<i>It's on another level!</i>

14:18.660 --> 14:21.410
<i>Will we be able to make up the 
difference in later events?!</i>

14:21.410 --> 14:25.030
Okay ladies and gentleman,
let's have another big round of applause!

14:25.030 --> 14:27.430
<i>Sure enough, Shirley's the favorite to win.</i>

14:27.430 --> 14:30.400
Now it's time for a break, 
so they can get changed.

14:30.400 --> 14:33.920
Be sure to come back for their 
special-skill demonstrations!

14:33.920 --> 14:36.170
Boxxo, we need you for a sec!

14:36.170 --> 14:38.430
Sorry, it won't take long!

14:38.430 --> 14:40.430
<i>What the heck's going on?</i>

14:41.510 --> 14:43.210
We probably don't...

14:43.210 --> 14:46.160
No, we <i>don't</i> stand a chance against Shirley,
as things stand!

14:46.160 --> 14:48.760
But there's nothing we can 
do about it by ourselves!

14:48.760 --> 14:51.390
We know this is asking for a whole lot,

14:51.390 --> 14:54.650
but do you have some product that 
can make us more appealing?

14:54.650 --> 14:56.400
Anything, please!

14:57.450 --> 14:59.980
<i>It's not like there are no options.</i>

14:59.980 --> 15:02.950
<i>But we don't have time to do 
this for all three of them.</i>

15:02.950 --> 15:06.900
<i>I h-a-v a pl-an b-it n-o-t e-ne-f.</i>

15:06.900 --> 15:09.640
You have an idea, but there's 
not enough of something?

15:09.640 --> 15:10.450
Not enough tools?

15:10.450 --> 15:11.290
<i>Too bad.</i>

15:11.290 --> 15:12.920
Then you mean time?

15:12.920 --> 15:14.140
<i>Hello there.</i>

15:14.140 --> 15:17.620
Meaning, there's not enough 
time to do all three of us?

15:17.620 --> 15:18.980
<i>Hello there.</i>

15:19.240 --> 15:21.820
Then it can just be you two.

15:21.820 --> 15:25.270
After all, I get the prize 
if either of you win.

15:25.270 --> 15:27.050
Um, you sure?

15:27.050 --> 15:30.940
Sure! You two are more set on 
taking first place anyway.

15:30.940 --> 15:32.620
Sure thing, it's a deal!

15:32.620 --> 15:33.500
Thanks.

15:33.500 --> 15:36.740
Boxxo! Please, I'll go through anything!

15:36.740 --> 15:40.400
<i>I'm not confident, to be honest, 
but I'll do what I can!</i>

15:41.270 --> 15:43.220
<i>Form change!</i>

15:43.640 --> 15:46.430
<i>A cosmetics vending machine!</i>

15:46.430 --> 15:48.260
Wh-What's this?

15:48.520 --> 15:51.240
<i>Ever since the three of 
them decided to enter,</i>

15:51.240 --> 15:54.400
<i>I've actually been reading lots 
of fashion magazines every night,</i>

15:54.400 --> 15:57.770
<i>and repeatedly practicing makeup skills 
to see what'll grab peoples' hearts.</i>

15:57.770 --> 16:02.010
<i>By the way, I bought all these cosmetics 
in the name of vending machine fandom.</i>

16:02.330 --> 16:06.240
<i>Now, time to make these two
 shine with my technique!</i>

16:09.280 --> 16:16.180
<i>Boxxo vending machine power, makeup!</i>

16:20.460 --> 16:28.910
<i>Boxxo vending machine power, makeup!</i>

16:33.870 --> 16:35.920
Boxxo!

16:35.920 --> 16:38.800
Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for waiting!

16:39.090 --> 16:41.690
It is now time for the 
special-skill demonstration.

16:41.690 --> 16:44.310
We'll start with #1, Acowi.

16:44.310 --> 16:45.870
Take it away!

16:45.870 --> 16:47.940
High-speed sorting of gold, 
silver, and copper coins!

16:50.570 --> 16:52.560
Gold! Copper! Silver! Silver! 
Copper! Gold! Gold!

16:54.230 --> 16:57.070
Secret rite! Mixing a high-mega potion!

16:59.510 --> 17:01.990
Time to eat!

17:01.990 --> 17:04.010
Nice one!

17:13.120 --> 17:14.530
Here goes.

17:18.880 --> 17:20.470
Go!

17:22.550 --> 17:25.860
<i>Suori and Kikoyu didn't 
do anything themselves.</i>

17:25.860 --> 17:27.570
<i>Next it's finally Shui's turn.</i>

17:27.570 --> 17:30.570
<i>How's she going to dress,
and how's she going to show off?</i>

17:31.410 --> 17:32.180
<i>Huh?!</i>

17:32.180 --> 17:34.530
<i>A-A gym outfit!</i>

17:33.110 --> 17:36.490
<b>Shui</b>

17:34.530 --> 17:36.490
<i>I never thought she'd choose this!</i>

17:36.490 --> 17:38.890
That outfit looks easy to move around in.

17:38.890 --> 17:42.050
I've never seen that outfit before, 
but it kinda seems just right.

17:42.050 --> 17:46.740
Yes. It's hard to put into words,
but something about it seems to draw one's eyes.

17:53.530 --> 17:57.040
<i>This might be the best 
crowd response so far!</i>

17:57.040 --> 18:01.430
Moving on! Hulemy and Lammis 
are appearing as a duo!

18:01.430 --> 18:03.920
Show us what you can do!

18:09.190 --> 18:13.370
<i>Hulemy! I <i>never</i> thought 
you'd take this approach!</i>

18:13.370 --> 18:15.820
<i>And I'm surprised by how 
well it works for you!</i>

18:16.730 --> 18:19.620
<i>Lammis pulled off the blazer look!</i>

18:19.620 --> 18:20.550
<i>This is...</i>

18:20.550 --> 18:23.860
<i>This is undeniably cute!</i>

18:24.200 --> 18:27.870
It seems Hulemy is going to 
unveil her new magic item!

18:27.870 --> 18:29.440
Let's see!

18:31.370 --> 18:33.500
Okay, it's ready.

18:33.500 --> 18:34.640
Activate!

18:44.630 --> 18:45.640
Wow!

18:45.640 --> 18:47.170
Okay then!

18:48.760 --> 18:50.170
Stupid! Don't—

18:54.120 --> 18:55.270
Hey.

19:00.660 --> 19:03.150
<i>They got the crowd going the most,</i>

19:03.150 --> 19:06.230
<i>and I want to have faith that the 
outfits and makeup helped, too.</i>

19:06.650 --> 19:10.320
Now, what you've all been 
waiting for, our last entry!

19:13.650 --> 19:15.040
What?!

19:15.040 --> 19:17.700
Mom, d-do I have to read this?!

19:18.160 --> 19:20.980
Uh, I beg your pardon.

19:20.980 --> 19:24.310
Everyone, I apologize.

19:24.310 --> 19:26.450
Shirley...

19:26.450 --> 19:29.680
has suddenly fallen ill, 
and will have to withdraw!

19:31.930 --> 19:33.220
What happened?!

19:33.220 --> 19:34.680
I hope she's okay?

19:34.680 --> 19:37.120
<i>I never thought Shirley would drop out!</i>

19:37.120 --> 19:40.180
<i>Now there's no telling who will win.</i>

19:42.940 --> 19:45.470
<i>I guess we can only wait for the result.</i>

19:45.470 --> 19:48.440
I look forward to seeing who wins.

19:48.440 --> 19:49.940
<i>Huh? Shirley?</i>

19:49.940 --> 19:52.250
<i>Hel-th too bad.</i>

19:50.410 --> 19:59.960
<b>Kocha Kadan</b>

19:52.250 --> 19:54.740
Yes, I'm better now.

19:54.740 --> 19:57.630
But it's too bad I had to 
withdraw partway through.

19:58.460 --> 20:00.010
Thank you.

20:00.010 --> 20:03.910
<i>She looks healthy enough to me.</i>

20:03.910 --> 20:05.100
<i>What if...</i>

20:05.100 --> 20:07.420
<i>F-a-l-s a-l-a-r-m?</i>

20:07.900 --> 20:09.470
Maybe, maybe not.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.260
<i>Aha.</i>

20:11.260 --> 20:13.510
<i>This is just speculation,</i>

20:13.520 --> 20:16.810
<i>but maybe Shirley only ever said 
she was going to be in the contest</i>

20:16.810 --> 20:19.150
<i>to get people more excited about it.</i>

20:19.150 --> 20:20.980
<i>Thank you very much.</i>

20:21.740 --> 20:23.230
Don't mention it.

20:23.230 --> 20:27.740
Voting has ended. All we can 
do now is wait for the result.

20:27.740 --> 20:32.910
<i>All Hevee can love is shoes, so I wonder 
if he had any interest in this grand prix.</i>

20:32.910 --> 20:35.500
<i>P-r-e-d-i-c-t f-ers-t pl-a-s.</i>

20:35.500 --> 20:37.360
Let's see.

20:37.360 --> 20:42.700
Personally, I think Director Origin's 
bright red boots deserve first place.

20:42.700 --> 20:43.760
<i>Too bad.</i>

20:43.760 --> 20:46.260
<i>It's true, Hevee never wavers.</i>

20:46.260 --> 20:47.250
Ladies and gentlemen!

20:47.440 --> 20:49.750
Thank you for being patient for so long!

20:49.750 --> 20:52.260
It's finally time to announce the winner!

20:52.260 --> 20:54.510
<i>Oh, here it comes!</i>

20:54.970 --> 20:59.100
Now! Just who might the champion be?!

21:01.520 --> 21:07.550
The honorable winner of the Clearflow Lake 
stratum Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix...

21:08.310 --> 21:12.760
is perky, super-strong Lammis!

21:12.760 --> 21:14.520
<i>You did it, Lammis!</i>

21:18.520 --> 21:22.300
I did it, Boxxo!

21:22.830 --> 21:26.040
We now present the champion 
Lammis with her prize.

21:26.310 --> 21:29.920
The grand prize is fifty Boxxo meal tickets!

21:29.920 --> 21:34.800
And, this magic item provided 
by Suori's company!

21:36.150 --> 21:37.650
Those boots!

21:38.210 --> 21:39.410
Finally...

21:41.390 --> 21:43.210
I finally found them!

21:43.890 --> 21:45.320
<i>What does he mean?</i>

21:45.320 --> 21:47.400
<i>Is there something up with those boots?</i>

21:51.910 --> 21:54.750
Boxxo! I won first place!

21:54.750 --> 21:57.620
I hope I get to eat until I'm full!

21:57.620 --> 21:58.780
<i>Congratulations!</i>

21:58.780 --> 22:01.990
<i>But something's come up that we 
should do before we celebrate!</i>

22:03.440 --> 22:07.940
How do you do, Suori? My name is Hevee.

22:07.940 --> 22:12.770
I accompany Boxxo when he hunts 
monsters and explores the dungeon.

22:12.770 --> 22:15.190
Thank you for your courtesy.

22:15.190 --> 22:17.240
My name is Suori.

22:17.240 --> 22:18.990
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

22:18.990 --> 22:21.310
So, what can I do for you?

22:21.310 --> 22:25.820
Yes, it's about the boots you 
provided for the first-place prize.

22:25.820 --> 22:28.030
Lammis, would you show them to us?

22:28.030 --> 22:29.560
Sure, here.

22:29.820 --> 22:33.130
The shape, size, quality...

22:33.560 --> 22:35.660
Sure enough, there can be no mistake.

22:36.060 --> 22:40.070
Am I correct that these are 
the Untiring Godsfeet?

22:40.070 --> 22:42.230
You are well informed.

22:42.230 --> 22:44.600
They are one of the masterpieces of Logdiem,

22:44.600 --> 22:47.470
a master craftsman renowned 
for their footwear.

22:47.710 --> 22:54.470
If you do not mind, I would like to 
know where you obtained these boots.

22:54.470 --> 22:56.590
Sure, fine by me.

22:56.590 --> 22:57.410
Yes, ma'am.

22:57.410 --> 23:02.080
Your father said he obtained those 
from the Scorching Sand stratum.

23:02.080 --> 23:06.900
I recall him being quite happy,
as they were a considerably good find.

23:06.900 --> 23:10.520
I see. The Scorching Sand stratum.

23:10.520 --> 23:12.500
Thank you so much.

23:13.690 --> 23:16.000
Uh, hey...?

23:21.890 --> 23:25.970
<i>I sold lots of alcohol at last 
night's grand prix wrap party.</i>

23:26.260 --> 23:28.930
<i>I bet soup with basket clams 
will be in demand today.</i>

23:28.930 --> 23:30.040
Boxxo!

23:30.040 --> 23:30.890
Hevee!

23:30.890 --> 23:32.220
Have you seen Hevee?!

23:33.040 --> 23:38.800
<i>Shui's sorrowful cry seemed to signal 
our brief time of fun coming to an end.</i>

23:37.510 --> 23:40.050
<b>Next Time</b>

23:37.510 --> 23:40.050
<b>Into the Scorching Desert</b>
